  "description": {
    "es": "Mixtape de 15 tracks que funciona como archivo personal: piezas compuestas y grabadas a lo largo de varios años que Klaus reúne en un solo objeto. Cruza nu-jazz, hip-hop jazz, neo-soul instrumental, vocoder y flauta. No es álbum convencional sino documento vivo de una práctica continua, presentado como mixtape porque ese formato permite la heterogeneidad que el LP cerrado no admite. Master de Victor Sáez y Chalo G.",
    "en": "15-track mixtape that functions as personal archive: pieces composed and recorded over several years that Klaus gathers in a single object. Crosses nu-jazz, hip-hop jazz, instrumental neo-soul, vocoder and flute. Not a conventional album but a living document of continuous practice, presented as mixtape because that format allows the heterogeneity a closed LP doesn't admit. Mastering by Victor Sáez and Chalo G."
  },
